# CLAUDE.md - Working Memory for {{OWNER_FIRST_NAME}}

Keep this file short. Claude reads it every session in this folder, so every line costs context. Long-lived facts Claude learns on its own go to its built-in memory; standing rules go to `~/.claude/rules/critical-rules.md`.

---

## Rules

Standing rules live in `~/.claude/rules/critical-rules.md` (loaded every session). The full text of each rule is in `~/Desktop/claude/rules/feedback_*.md`. One checker agent for things that ship - code merged to main, public posts, outbound messages. Everything else runs without one.

